{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c9ae2c93-b832-8594-97b1-778e39eb785e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T11:37:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diego Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:33:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Denise. My name is Diego Salazar. I'm calling about a pothole that took out my tire, and I'd like to get it on record with somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:34:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that. Where did this happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:34:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 404 Carroll Avenue. That's in the Fifth Ward. The hole sits in the road, close to the curb on the near side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 404 Carroll Avenue. And when did it happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This morning, a little before nine. I was pulling out to go down the street, and I dropped right in. The tire blew, just like that, and when I got a look at the wheel the rim is bent. I don't think it's holding air even with a new tire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:34:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Was anybody hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:34:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nobody hurt. Just the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:34:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Could you see the hole before you hit it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's the thing. It's full of water, all the way to the top, so it looks like the rest of the road. You can't tell how deep it is until you're in it. [pause] It's a wicked deep one, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:35:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the water hides them. Alright, I'll put in a report for a crew to look at the road there, so it gets checked and scheduled for repair."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:35:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I appreciate that. Could I get a reference number for it? I'd like to have something written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Hang on one second while I enter it. [pause] Okay, it's coming up. Do you have a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:35:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:35:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your reference number is PW, dash, 2, 6, 0, 2, 1, 2, dash, 0, 4, 1."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. P-W, dash, two six zero two one two, dash, zero four one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:35:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And can I get a number in case the crew has a question about where exactly it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0171. That's my cell, so if it cuts out just try me again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:36:10-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0171. Now, if you want to look into the damage to your car, that goes through a separate claim process. I can transfer you to the office that handles that, or you can ask when someone calls you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me hold off on that for the moment. I have to go pick up a rug that was being cleaned, and the shop closes early today. I'll get the car sorted out first and then see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:36:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Keep the reference number, and hold on to your tire and any receipts from the repair, and take a photo of the hole if you can do it safely."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:36:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I took two pictures already, standing on the sidewalk. The water's in them, so you can see how it looks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Those will help. The crew will be out as soon as they can work it into the schedule, and it depends on the weather and how many are on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:37:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Winter, you know. Alright, that's everything I needed. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:37:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Salazar. Take care getting that rug."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T11:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye now."
    }
  ],
